      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureReportsinOpenERP-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">User can export reports using this configuration for any analysis. User can create filter list and save it for future use.<br style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"/></span></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureReportsinOpenERP-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><h3 id=\"ConfigureReportsinOpenERP-1.Login\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Login</span></h3><p>Login to OpenERP with admin privileges.</p><h3 id=\"ConfigureReportsinOpenERP-2.ClickonPurchases,PurchaseOrders.\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>2. Click on Purchases, Purchase Orders</strong>.</span></h3><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Choose Purchases and then Purchase Order from left side panel as shown in the screenshot below.</span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ffe7ba81-a545-45c8-b1af-4374e780f2e2\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Example</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">As an example, we have added Purchase flow, similarly we can export any module report like Sales,Accounting,Warehouse</span></p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"Click on Purchases then click on Purchase order\" width=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719653&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=357\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719653&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"111411293\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Purchase Orders   OpenERP.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"111411310\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"45eb7717-752d-4031-8a60-6f7d78c7bede\" data-media-type=\"file\" title=\"Click on Purchases then click on Purchase order\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719653&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1033&amp;height=369 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719653&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=357 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Purchase Orders.</strong></span><br/></span></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureReportsinOpenERP-3.AddthedatefilterfromtheAdvancefilter.\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>3.</strong> Add<strong> the date filter from the Advance filter.</strong><br/></span></h3><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Advance_Date_filter_New.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444720151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=500\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/111411310/Advance_Date_filter_New.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444720151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"111411291\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Advance_Date_filter_New.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"111411310\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"178c38ef-c57b-4a00-81d0-9828c46cb5b2\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Advance_Date_filter_New.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444720151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1838&amp;height=919 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Advance_Date_filter_New.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444720151&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=500 1x\"></span><br/></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Advance Filters.</strong></span></p><h3 id=\"ConfigureReportsinOpenERP-3.ClickonReferenceColumn&amp;ExportReport.\"><span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>3. </strong></span><strong>Click on</strong></span><strong> Reference<strong> Column &amp; Export Report</strong>.</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Export.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719092&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=506\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Export.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719092&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"111411294\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Purchase Orders   OpenERP_Export.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"111411310\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"9c98cd93-b72e-4569-939c-64e08fdd0720\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Export.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719092&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1835&amp;height=929 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Export.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444719092&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=506 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Column name &amp; Export Report .</strong>                       </p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\" id=\"ConfigureReportsinOpenERP-4.WecanaddcolumnsfromtheAvailablefields&amp;savetheListforthefutureuse.\"><strong>4.We can add</strong> columns<strong> from the Available fields &amp; save the List for the future use.</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Future_List.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444718382&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=921&amp;height=626\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Future_List.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444718382&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"111411299\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Purchase Orders   OpenERP_Future_List.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"111411310\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"7\" data-media-id=\"77840c19-99db-4e1b-8fb9-d5b3e8a2ed2a\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Future_List.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444718382&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=921&amp;height=626 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/111411310/Purchase%20Orders%20%20%20OpenERP_Future_List.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1483444718382&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=921&amp;height=626 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Save Fields List</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">User can add configuration &amp; export report in any module of openerp.</p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e6921b04-2089-48cb-990e-45bb5d87af22\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-cssliststyle=\"none\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3